Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.64,0:00:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhados!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of that steel block as Kaido's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhhh %~~~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember your defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.74,0:00:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your helplessness!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhhhhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,SUBSCRIBE AND COMP certains dosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.40,0:00:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunder! Barbara!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pounding that steel\Nlike it's made of jelly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.08,0:00:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.82,0:00:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Five days remain until the raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:01:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move through Earth and\Nhorizon. We will find infinity for
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. Let's fight for this blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.76,0:01:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Seal as you win, take us far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up so I can come\Nback to this moment. So I can be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.30,0:01:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,present right here Throw away this\Nrough times we share Shut it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.32,0:01:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,do not be so afraid to podcast To have a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.54,0:01:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,friend right here And\NI will always be here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.12,0:01:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,by your side To take care of you Even in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In the darkest of times,\NI'll try looking brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.32,0:01:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright. Since we\Nare the ones who are men.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to rule the law We will\Nmove towards the horizon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find insanity\Nfor sure. We're a world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.92,0:02:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward ahead. We will\Nwin for sure, dreaming on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.46,0:02:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,we will move towards the\Nhorizon We will fight however
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.76,0:02:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,we can In order to be the\Nbest we will run To the top,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.34,0:02:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,to the end, we gotta be The\Nones that just keep dreaming of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.86,0:02:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't give up now I\Ncan never stop cause I gotta
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,give everything I got to Become\Nthe greatest of all times
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We will move towards the horizon We will
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Find infinite fortunes.\NWe'll one step ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.78,0:02:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll win with console. So keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.73,0:03:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-a-a-a-a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Kin'emon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.70,0:03:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull out your flyers, if you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.98,0:03:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to make an alteration.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.18,0:03:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Add two lines to the Habu Viper's belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing so will reveal Lord\NYasui's message to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Two lines?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, that makes sense. Yasui's quite
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.94,0:03:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,clever I see we got it looking good
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, put your hips into it. We'll be\Nsailing through rough waters to reach
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Onigashima we need something sturdy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.76,0:04:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lines on the Viper's\Nstomach. Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.44,0:04:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, Sir Kin'emon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.64,0:04:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.55,0:04:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then all is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.84,0:04:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Kinemona here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.82,0:04:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting those ships in tip-top shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.82,0:04:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.73,0:04:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.24,0:04:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.14,0:04:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Count on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go spread the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone will know about the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.76,0:04:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The people from Wano\Ncan take one look at the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.82,0:04:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,flyer and understand the\Nmessage in an instant,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.62,0:04:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, let's see if I can figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.94,0:04:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You add two lines to Viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Viper?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.54,0:04:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.48,0:04:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,One cannot understand it unless\Nthey know the names of Wano's ports.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Itachi Port.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.64,0:04:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Neko Port.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kairu Port.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:04:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mogura Port.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.26,0:05:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokage Port.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.60,0:05:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And Habu Port.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.58,0:05:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, the point is,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,each of these ports is associated\Nwith a particular animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So with the initial image of the viper,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.34,0:05:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,we implied that Habu port\Nwould be the rendezvous point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you add two lines to a viper,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,then they appear as legs, and\Nwith a moment's consideration,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the image of a lizard\Nwill likely come to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.48,0:05:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokage port is associated with the lizard,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,so our allies will understand that our\Nnew rendezvous point is the port in Udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The flyer is considered a prank,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so there is little chance\Nthat our foes will catch on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.32,0:05:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's truly a marvel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Yasui deceived the enemy and gave our
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.78,0:05:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,thwarted plan a path\Nforward in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our ally to the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.44,0:05:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, it is a debt we can never repay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.80,0:05:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If we put his efforts to waste,\Nit will be our shame as Samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.82,0:05:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm suddenly reminded of his words.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what he told us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.94,0:06:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll become the guardian\Ndeities of Wano itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.16,0:06:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A brilliant man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Taken too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, a few challenges yet remain,\Nbut we owe much to your efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.68,0:06:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, our number\Nof allies has increased,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and our friends have been reassembled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Although Dinturo's whereabouts are still\Na mystery, we have seven of the Akazaya 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,all as strong as ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This turned around fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we got a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We need 5,000 troops, right? Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,let's stop patting ourselves on\Nthe back we're wasting valuable
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:07:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,time all right in that case let's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Discuss the plan. We'll take Kaido's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,head at any cost and orochis as\Nwell we shall do more than avenge
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,lord odin we'll save this land
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,check it out a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,piece of trivia
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.06,0:07:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For those determined enough, there\Nwere actually two ways to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,the land of water the first is\Nthe dangerous path that the straw
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.98,0:07:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,hats took carried up the waterfalls\Nby giant koi fish the other is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to pass through a massive cave\Nhidden behind one of the waterfalls
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,needless to say this will not end well for
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,those without kaido\Nand orichi's permission
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.76,0:07:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,At the end of the cave lies Moldora Port.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.56,0:08:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,From there, a gondola will haul up\Nboth crew and cargo to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.18,0:08:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,After a short trip,\Nthey'll exit the tunnel
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring-a-ding-ding, Kaido, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the house, as one might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.42,0:08:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't think you'd bother coming\Nback here for the party, Apu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.14,0:08:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't miss it for the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.86,0:08:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Golden Festival is here,\Nand it's gonna be tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I never skip out on a party\Nor give up on a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be wild this year, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My kind of scene! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now groove with me, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.24,0:09:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The numbers from Okikashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Or they'll eat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.74,0:09:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the numbers have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are some messy drunks\Nif I've ever seen them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.78,0:09:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them to go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just a warm-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The real party's right around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.60,0:09:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drink to that! One more round!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.54,0:09:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They were trying to\Nkill each other earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey listen up, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, we got some important news\Nabout the Beast Pirates and the Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.14,0:09:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,pirates too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.12,0:09:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We have decided to form\Nan alliance. Hooray! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.68,0:10:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So first things First, we combine\Nour strength and conquer the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can go back to killing each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this true?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.08,0:10:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You do not jest! Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.42,0:10:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What a blessed day!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.50,0:10:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Hiyori is alive and\Nwell! That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.96,0:10:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I was relieved as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart aches for Otoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.66,0:10:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She has endured so much pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.80,0:10:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs some time to adjust\Nand will require a guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.72,0:10:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I shall refrain\Nfrom meeting with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.82,0:10:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.58,0:10:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sentimentality has no place in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please lend them your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.28,0:11:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.84,0:11:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Find a way to protect the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.38,0:11:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, this is unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.04,0:11:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're certain it's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.68,0:11:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Our little tomboy's become so elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My, she's truly grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.18,0:11:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Learning of your imprisonment,\Nwe truly fared for the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.98,0:11:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she now? Is she guarded?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.42,0:11:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She is in a safe place at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so delightful to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.22,0:11:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What a tremendous relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.24,0:11:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, Nisuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyori! Drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.66,0:12:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.57,0:12:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro-Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were the one who rescued her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.46,0:12:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I am grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She hacks a bit rough and tumble,\Nbut she's actually fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That Crybaby could be quite the handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.18,0:12:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That Crybaby's 18 years\Nolder than you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You really gotta get your\Nmind out of the past, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.54,0:12:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.58,0:12:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So she has a height and age advantage now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I never considered that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How long have you known, and\Nyou didn't bother telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That goddess is Momonosuke's sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.77,0:13:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop staring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, little buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you need anything, just\Ncome to Uncle Sangoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.38,0:13:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.92,0:13:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Sangoro, that's\Nenough fooling her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.42,0:13:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Preparations are complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.24,0:13:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you quite sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We have already come to an agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Hitetsu, this is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.78,0:13:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kitetsu II.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.08,0:13:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It was confiscated from\NLufi Taro and Udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.68,0:13:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.59,0:13:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.84,0:13:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He took it from me without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kitetsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.24,0:13:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling it was a famed blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.96,0:13:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my name is Tenguyama Hitetsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a swordsmith from the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.60,0:13:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.06,0:14:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For two decades,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have awaited the opportunity to be\Nin your presence, Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I now bequeath these swords to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,These were once Lord Oden's\Nprecious weapons, Ame no Habakiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the one who cuts down the\Nhighest heavens And Enma,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.66,0:14:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,the one who slices\Nthrough the deepest hells
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Like Shusui, they stand among legends\Nas two of the 21 excellent great blades
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.24,0:14:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you like to do\Nwith my Masterpieces, my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The choice is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But do not mistake this feeling for fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.72,0:14:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd merely prefer it if you\Nkept it for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.42,0:14:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Enma, it now belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.06,0:14:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,However, please heed my warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.06,0:15:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The only man who has ever tamed\Nthat blade was Kozuki Odin himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.62,0:15:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There has never been another.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.94,0:15:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Try cutting down a tree,\Nto test its fine edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.96,0:15:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Zoro, I only say this out\Nof the kindness of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I were you, I would\Nnot accept that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.74,0:15:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He cut off the cliff?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Sorry to revive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It will extract the wielder's rioh all on\Nits own, and always cuts more than needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.16,0:16:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Had you been a normal swordsman, there\Nwould have been but a husk left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.50,0:16:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.82,0:16:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If, tell me, would you\Nprefer a different blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.90,0:17:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, this wouldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Emma, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.86,0:17:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I could get used to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.38,0:17:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I do, I'll become\Na much stronger swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.76,0:17:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What an unbelievable fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up the pace, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't got a lot of\Ntime to waste, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.18,0:17:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This baby needs to carry\Na hundred thousand people!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not seem like a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.36,0:17:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.50,0:17:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't nothing wrong\Nwith aiming for the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.98,0:17:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.26,0:17:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How many are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.00,0:17:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Oroi, what have you\Nlearned about the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.44,0:17:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to gather some helpful intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.16,0:17:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to alarm you, but the Beast\NPirates have about 20,000 soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.98,0:17:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,while Shogun Orochi's army\Nis about 10,000 strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.42,0:18:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,we need to be prepared to fight 30,000\Nenemies once we arrive in Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, we have the mansion blueprints,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.40,0:18:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but we're still fighting\Nin our foes' backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.76,0:18:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, at least it's\Naway from our homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We only have about 4,000 men at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,While we are not plotting an Alto\Nwar, our numbers are clearly lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.58,0:18:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonetheless, we must commit to the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.82,0:18:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tarry out the raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.22,0:18:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our only opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.24,0:18:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Still gotta try.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're scared, Mouchman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.78,0:18:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.40,0:18:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That was all wrong, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're straining yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.86,0:19:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.77,0:19:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.06,0:19:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need you to\Ncalm your ass down a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.14,0:19:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo, don't you have your\Nown sword training to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.02,0:19:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm focused, so have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, I suppose I do have one\Nissue that's continued to vex me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.60,0:19:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunachi is an exclamation used\Nto push oneself, yes? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.88,0:19:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Kiku advised me against using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.52,0:19:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a saying some old\Nguy from my village told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't really say I've used it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.38,0:19:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.06,0:19:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.97,0:20:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Utama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You had me worried sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.36,0:20:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings. Kin'emon here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.16,0:20:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.66,0:20:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kibi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.57,0:20:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hakumai! Ringo! Udon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We've gathered 200\Nadditional troops in total!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.42,0:20:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We now have 4,200 troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.68,0:20:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I have yet to hear from Sir Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we're better off\Nwithout his assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.86,0:20:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.00,0:20:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We need strong people like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.14,0:20:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You trained so hard that\Nyou're tuckered out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.04,0:21:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, officer, hey! The\Nfestival? Soon release us, not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.86,0:21:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,happening pipe down damn\Nit this is our final chance
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.84,0:21:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone is risking their\Nlives for this unfortunately
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.08,0:21:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,there's not much we can\Ndo about the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.10,0:21:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,they have the arrested\Nparties under a watchful
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.84,0:21:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,eye even family members\Nprotesting are being locked
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Away, a true loss\Nconsidering that some of our
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.80,0:21:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,heartiest samurai are there\Nbut we must press onward
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone you have my gratitude use\Nthe remaining time for preparations
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.06,0:21:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and travel understood we'll meet\Nat the rendezvous port do take care
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:21:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I made one for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.60,0:22:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're grateful for your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.68,0:22:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Sir Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.94,0:22:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to take our leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.16,0:22:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We must get there before\Neveryone else. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.42,0:22:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My group will head out on the sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hidden along the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.24,0:22:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We are as prepared as we'll ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, we're counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.72,0:22:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.38,0:22:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,See you at the port, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.70,0:22:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.36,0:22:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Countless smokestacks pollute the\Nskies across the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.06,0:22:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And beneath them, countless\Nlaborers slave away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.46,0:22:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Think it's true?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.84,0:22:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I think what's true?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.70,0:23:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What Lord Yasui said.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you heard that he was covering\Nfor the Akazaya Samurai? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.44,0:23:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He took the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That flyer going around\Nwasn't his prank after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the actual signal for the raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.92,0:23:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.83,0:23:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.94,0:23:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving us false hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.26,0:23:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The events happened 20 years ago, But\NWano's wounds still haven't healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.38,0:23:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe Kin'emon and the others\Nare still alive after all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.12,0:23:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If they are, their\Nstrength has surely faded.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.48,0:23:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have been through so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.48,0:23:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Their spirits would be crushed by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.38,0:23:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no hope for a\Ncountry this isolated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.24,0:23:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no outside help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.88,0:23:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be a complete bloodbath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.30,0:23:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not strong enough\Nto face Kaido alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.24,0:23:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, seven of the Akazaya Nine, a ku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.32,0:23:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and one young noble press on\Nwith determination in their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.92,0:23:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The malnourished land\Nbeneath them trumbles under
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.92,0:24:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,their feet like frost\Nduring a bitter winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.18,0:24:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking through the scattered\Nclouds and rising smog,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.66,0:24:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the sun shines upon them as the\Nnine shadows dance like spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.92,0:24:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet these are not vengeful ghosts,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.04,0:24:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but warriors of flesh and\Nblood armed with sturdy steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.20,0:24:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a tale twenty years in the making.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.60,0:24:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,After we win this battle,\Nwe'll build them proper graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you've become quite adept.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.08,0:24:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.99,0:24:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems as though Enma\Nhas met a worthy owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.30,0:24:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You already wield Kitetsu III.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.62,0:24:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's one of mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.30,0:24:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.14,0:24:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.05,0:24:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,have you not questioned\Nwhy the famed Blade Lady
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.18,0:24:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyori left you feel so\Ncomfortable in your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.94,0:25:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It works much like a cursed blade does.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.76,0:25:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The weak cannot handle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.76,0:25:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Though there is a much bigger reason why\Nit feels familiar to you as you wield it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.60,0:25:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You may find this shocking,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.96,0:25:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but your Wado Ichimonji and Enma\Nwere crafted by the very same man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.74,0:25:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the legendary blacksmith\NShimotsuki Koza over 50 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.74,0:25:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke the laws of this land\Nand left everything behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.76,0:25:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Hiyori might have\Ngiven you the memento
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.16,0:25:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,from her father because\Nshe recognized that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.38,0:25:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Enma has yet to be forged\Ninto a black blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.44,0:25:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Its rank will depend on your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.64,0:25:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have some fun with this
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.26,0:25:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,so all is well in Udon must\Nhave been a false alarm yes
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.72,0:25:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,no problems to report this\Nplace is under control so please
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.92,0:26:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,don't worry about us sir we'll\Ntake care of the prisoners
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.28,0:26:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,from here what an untrustworthy\Nfool he turned out to be
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.12,0:26:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.06,0:26:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I have this\Nintel, this is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.68,0:26:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The plans have been changed\Nfrom Habu port to Tokage port.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.62,0:26:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And Kozuki Hiyori still\Nlives in the north, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.80,0:27:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.78,0:27:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather round.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.40,0:27:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky is clear and the cherry blossoms\Nflutter about in the flower capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.74,0:27:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The day of the fire festival\Nhas arrived at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.80,0:27:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A historic battle that will affect the\Nfate of the entire world is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.68,0:27:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
